WEBVTT

00:07.380 --> 00:09.880
My name is Takumi Kayano.

00:09.880 --> 00:11.760
Just a few hours ago,

00:11.760 --> 00:14.800
I still lived normally as
any Japanese does.

00:15.640 --> 00:16.720
But now...

00:23.600 --> 00:25.810
I'm surrounded by monsters
in another world.

00:27.520 --> 00:30.230
Red Wolf, a C-rank monster?

00:33.110 --> 00:34.320
Air Shot!

00:42.410 --> 00:44.210
I have to battle right off the bat?

00:45.330 --> 00:46.540
Inventory.

00:51.510 --> 00:54.380
The reason this happened is...

00:56.220 --> 00:58.890
I am terribly sorry!

00:58.890 --> 01:01.310
I am very terribly sorry!

01:01.310 --> 01:04.890
Uh... I don't get it even
if you apologize profusely.

01:04.890 --> 01:07.270
Who are you, and where am I?

01:10.360 --> 01:12.320
What kind of situation am I in?!

01:12.320 --> 01:14.820
Now it looks like I'm the one at fault.

01:16.570 --> 01:19.030
My name is Sylphyryll.

01:19.030 --> 01:21.650
Oh, I'm Takumi Kayano.

01:21.650 --> 01:22.740
Nice to meet you.

01:22.740 --> 01:27.210
From your status, I am kind of a God.

01:27.210 --> 01:28.290
What?

01:28.290 --> 01:30.670
And this is a part of the divine land.

01:30.670 --> 01:32.670
What the hell?
Is this a new kind of scam?

01:32.670 --> 01:35.090
- This is not a scam.
- Huh?!

01:35.090 --> 01:38.590
I-I can read minds, but right now
I am not reading yours, I swear!

01:38.590 --> 01:40.800
Then how could you know
what I was thinking?!

01:40.800 --> 01:42.260
I just felt it somehow!

01:42.260 --> 01:44.810
What a strange dude.

01:44.810 --> 01:46.730
So, um...

01:46.730 --> 01:48.980
Ah, you can just call me Syl.

01:48.980 --> 01:52.610
Syl, can you explain to me
what happened in brief?

01:52.610 --> 01:54.190
Ah, pardon me.

01:54.190 --> 01:57.990
I made a mistake and
accidentally killed you.

01:57.990 --> 01:58.700
Huh?

01:58.700 --> 02:01.660
What?!

02:04.950 --> 02:06.540
According to Syl,

02:06.540 --> 02:10.000
when he tried to repair the tear
in the space-time continuum,

02:10.000 --> 02:11.960
he put too much power

02:11.960 --> 02:15.550
and accidentally killed me
on the other side of the tear.

02:15.550 --> 02:20.760
It appears my life is over
at 28 years old.

02:20.760 --> 02:25.310
My current body is Syl's creation
and this is the world he governs.

02:25.310 --> 02:27.730
I got reincarnated here, in Etelldia.

02:28.270 --> 02:31.100
This body is equipped with
this world's basic knowledge

02:31.100 --> 02:33.940
and language as well as various skills.

02:35.820 --> 02:38.780
(Name: Takumi Kayano)
So this is my status.

02:38.780 --> 02:40.410
(Race: Human?)
I got younger too.

02:40.410 --> 02:41.740
(Disciple of the God of Wind (Temporary))
Level 3?

02:41.740 --> 02:43.910
(Age: 20)
Because I defeated the Red Wolf?

02:44.280 --> 02:45.540
A monster?!

02:47.290 --> 02:48.370
Kids?!

02:54.630 --> 03:00.260
♪Leisurely, leisurely,
let's slowly familiarize ourselves♪

03:00.260 --> 03:05.740
(A Journey Through Another World:
Raising Kids While Adventuring)

03:06.310 --> 03:11.270
♪The adventure to a new world is beginning♪

03:11.270 --> 03:16.110
♪Into a journey where
we can find fun things♪

03:17.610 --> 03:22.990
♪There are many encounters,
it's so exciting♪

03:22.990 --> 03:29.160
♪If you're with your family,
the things you can do will multiply♪

03:29.160 --> 03:32.080
♪It's okay to worry,
but you must not be overprotective♪

03:32.080 --> 03:35.040
♪I want you to praise me when
I try something and succeed♪

03:35.040 --> 03:37.840
♪It will be a wonderful party
if we can do this and that♪

03:37.840 --> 03:42.720
♪Because we will be together forever♪

03:43.180 --> 03:45.890
♪Please pat my head♪

03:45.890 --> 03:49.020
♪With your hand that I truly love♪

03:49.020 --> 03:54.650
♪I will send you thank you from
the deepest part of my heart, okay?♪

03:54.650 --> 03:57.650
♪Please pat me more♪

03:57.650 --> 04:00.780
♪See me with those eyes
filled with kindness♪

04:00.780 --> 04:07.120
♪I want this smile to last,
forever and ever♪

04:07.120 --> 04:12.710
♪Leisurely, leisurely,
let's slowly walk on♪

04:13.210 --> 04:18.590
♪Leisurely, Yururing,
I am happy, Travel Days♪

04:21.650 --> 04:21.800
(Another World and Twins)

04:21.800 --> 04:24.380
(Another World and Twins)
A twin boy and girl?

04:24.380 --> 04:24.970
(Another World and Twins)

04:24.970 --> 04:26.280
(Another World and Twins)
Are they lost?

04:28.890 --> 04:31.930
Hello. Are you alone?

04:32.600 --> 04:34.520
Where are your father and mother?

04:35.020 --> 04:36.230
What should I do?

04:36.230 --> 04:38.480
I can't just leave them here.

04:40.230 --> 04:41.820
Are you hungry?

04:42.490 --> 04:43.860
Wait for a bit.

04:43.860 --> 04:48.760
(Inventory)
I believe Syl put some foods in my inventory.

04:48.760 --> 04:49.700
(Inventory)
This will do.

04:53.580 --> 04:55.120
Here, eat this.

04:57.250 --> 04:58.540
It's delicious.

05:10.850 --> 05:12.810
Their clothes are in tatters, too.

05:14.270 --> 05:15.120
(Kid's Clothes)
Here it is.

05:15.140 --> 05:17.440
Okay, lift your arms.

05:23.640 --> 05:27.490
I want to get out of this forest
and into the city.

05:27.490 --> 05:29.120
Do you guys want to tag along?

05:29.620 --> 05:32.120
I am Takumi. Nice to meet you.

05:32.120 --> 05:35.080
What's your name?
And how old are you?

05:35.620 --> 05:38.120
They don't talk at all.

05:38.120 --> 05:40.170
I guess I'll see
their status by Appraise.

05:41.020 --> 05:41.550
(Race: Human? Age: 5, Level:12)

05:41.550 --> 05:44.740
(Skill: Water Magic, Martial Arts, Throw,)
They are five years old... But no name?

05:46.300 --> 05:47.470
Okay, I made up my mind.

05:47.470 --> 05:49.180
You're Alan.

05:49.180 --> 05:50.930
And you're Elena.

05:50.930 --> 05:52.390
Now, come with me!

05:58.850 --> 06:02.230
They follow me just fine,
they surely have stamina.

06:02.230 --> 06:05.440
But they are still kids,
so I have to take a lot of rest.

06:05.440 --> 06:07.200
Eh? Wait, Alan, Elena!

06:07.200 --> 06:08.410
What's wrong...

06:08.410 --> 06:09.870
Monsters?!

06:09.870 --> 06:12.040
That's dangerous!
Come back here, you two!

06:13.080 --> 06:14.240
Right! I have magic!

06:14.240 --> 06:17.580
Wait, I might hit them from this angle!

06:17.580 --> 06:19.040
What should I...?

06:26.720 --> 06:29.010
So strong!
What's with these five-year-olds?!

06:31.340 --> 06:34.390
Did both of you run because
you noticed the monsters?

06:36.060 --> 06:38.020
Let's see...

06:38.020 --> 06:41.520
From now on, if you find anything,
would you tell me first?

06:41.520 --> 06:43.860
You'll surprise me otherwise.

06:46.480 --> 06:47.690
Now that I think of it,

06:47.690 --> 06:51.450
they're doing fine alone
in this dangerous forest, after all.

06:51.450 --> 06:53.490
Of course, they are so strong.

06:59.210 --> 07:02.790
Right. You're telling me that
you found a monster, huh?

07:03.340 --> 07:05.460
Great job. Good kids!

07:08.260 --> 07:11.220
T-They're so cute.

07:11.930 --> 07:15.060
After that, both of them beat
the monsters one after another,

07:15.060 --> 07:17.180
that I didn't have to lift a finger.

07:18.020 --> 07:21.350
The sun is going down,
so let's have dinner here.

07:21.980 --> 07:24.900
Alan, Elena, help me gather
some dry branches.

07:41.540 --> 07:43.420
At first, they're very guarded,

07:44.130 --> 07:46.380
but now they start to smile.

07:46.380 --> 07:48.840
Maybe that means they get closer to me?

07:55.010 --> 07:57.390
Alan, Elena, come over.

07:59.180 --> 08:03.560
And this is how I began
my journey in Etelldia.

08:05.060 --> 08:07.820
Alan, Elena, we've arrived in the city!

08:09.150 --> 08:12.900
What? You said you're from
the Forest of Gaia?

08:12.900 --> 08:14.110
Yes, that's right.

08:16.900 --> 08:18.240
Oh, right...

08:18.240 --> 08:21.040
The Forest of Gaia is a dangerous forest
recommended for A rank.

08:21.660 --> 08:24.500
Of course, they'd be suspicious
with the kids here.

08:24.500 --> 08:27.920
I departed from the village
for medicinal herbs.

08:27.920 --> 08:30.510
I didn't go far into the forest

08:30.510 --> 08:33.380
and these kids are strong enough
to fend for themselves.

08:33.880 --> 08:36.090
So? Did you get the medicinal herb?

08:36.090 --> 08:39.430
Yes. I got lucky and found it near.

08:39.430 --> 08:42.310
I see, don't push yourself.

08:42.310 --> 08:44.140
Then, show me your identity card.

08:44.140 --> 08:45.060
Identity card?

08:45.060 --> 08:46.940
You want to
enter the city, right?

08:46.950 --> 08:48.020
Well...

08:48.020 --> 08:51.860
I'm from the village,
so I don't have one.

08:51.860 --> 08:55.320
I see. Then I will screen
and process you over here.

08:55.820 --> 08:58.030
First, take this crystal ball.

08:58.620 --> 09:00.990
So it's a magical device
to search criminal records.

09:00.990 --> 09:04.500
I believe these kids never do any crime,

09:04.500 --> 09:07.960
but they're mysterious too,
I wonder if it'd be okay.

09:07.960 --> 09:10.050
All right, you're clear.

09:10.050 --> 09:11.380
Thank God...

09:12.170 --> 09:14.470
Now, this is your temporary identity card.

09:15.010 --> 09:19.390
If you're going to stay for a long time,
make an identity card at the guild.

09:19.390 --> 09:20.430
I understand.

09:35.240 --> 09:37.950
They're afraid of strangers, huh...

09:47.370 --> 09:50.040
You two, please wait here for a second.

09:59.010 --> 10:00.640
Can you hear me, Syl?

10:04.060 --> 10:06.480
I can hear you clearly, Takumi.

10:07.060 --> 10:09.150
How's your life over there?

10:09.150 --> 10:10.690
About that...

10:10.690 --> 10:14.190
I met twin children in the forest.

10:14.190 --> 10:18.400
I can't leave them so
I bring them to this city, but...

10:19.860 --> 10:23.660
I can't look after them, so I'm thinking
of handing them to an institution...

10:24.370 --> 10:25.250
Wait! Wait!

10:25.250 --> 10:27.830
I knew that was your doing!

10:27.830 --> 10:29.580
I thought it was strange.

10:30.630 --> 10:36.170
I was sent to A rank-recommended forest,
yet I can beat all spawning monsters

10:36.170 --> 10:37.670
and there were kids in the forest...

10:37.670 --> 10:39.090
I am sorry!

10:39.090 --> 10:42.800
I don't need your sorry,
just explain about those kids.

10:43.300 --> 10:44.720
On that part...

10:44.720 --> 10:46.720
I can't say it myself.

10:46.720 --> 10:48.020
Eh? What do you mean?

10:48.640 --> 10:52.690
In this world, there are five gods:
the God of Wind, Fire, Water, Earth,

10:52.690 --> 10:56.480
and the Creator God Marianolla, right?

10:56.480 --> 11:00.160
Since you, as the God of Wind,
can't say anything,

11:00.160 --> 11:02.370
so that means the Gods are involved?

11:02.370 --> 11:04.990
Takumi, you're amazing!
It's just like you...

11:04.990 --> 11:06.950
Ah, I can't say more!

11:06.950 --> 11:09.790
Those kids are not normal kids

11:09.790 --> 11:12.210
and it was dangerous
to keep them the way they were.

11:12.210 --> 11:13.420
That's all I can tell you.

11:13.420 --> 11:17.550
I get it, I won't ask any further.

11:17.550 --> 11:20.870
So all I need to do is
take care of them, right?

11:20.870 --> 11:23.760
Yes! That will be a great help!

11:24.640 --> 11:28.430
But doesn't that make
my coming a convenience?

11:28.430 --> 11:30.810
- Are you angry?
- Nope.

11:30.810 --> 11:33.520
I wish you told me from the start.

11:33.520 --> 11:35.110
I-I am sorry.

11:36.150 --> 11:40.070
But I didn't mean to put them
in an institution from the start.

11:40.070 --> 11:41.150
Huh?

11:44.490 --> 11:46.740
Sorry to make you wait, Alan, Elena.

11:47.330 --> 11:49.290
Let's go to the lodging.

11:49.290 --> 11:50.710
You two are tired, right?

11:50.710 --> 11:53.040
Tonight we'll sleep on the bed!

12:04.970 --> 12:07.810
Look! It's so fluffy!

12:07.810 --> 12:09.350
It's so comfortable.

12:35.540 --> 12:36.540
Good morning.

12:37.590 --> 12:39.500
- Good... morning.
- Good morning.

12:39.880 --> 12:41.130
They talked!

12:41.130 --> 12:42.970
It's my first time hearing them talk!

12:44.220 --> 12:45.180
Yeah.

12:45.180 --> 12:47.140
Alan, Elena, good morning.

12:47.140 --> 12:51.680
Since arriving in the city, I worried about
how they were so gloomy and seem scared.

12:51.680 --> 12:53.140
But this is a huge progress!

12:53.850 --> 12:57.190
All right! Today, let's visit
the adventurer guild!

12:57.190 --> 12:58.110
- Okay.
- Okay.

13:01.070 --> 13:04.950
Good day. My name is Luna,
and I'm the receptionist.

13:04.950 --> 13:06.780
Please state your business.

13:06.780 --> 13:09.740
I would like to register as an adventurer.

13:09.740 --> 13:11.240
And these kids too.

13:11.240 --> 13:13.750
There is no age limit
for registration, right?

13:13.750 --> 13:15.250
Yes...

13:15.250 --> 13:19.000
There is no limit,
so you can register but...

13:19.000 --> 13:20.210
Please, do so.

13:20.210 --> 13:24.670
Then, please write down everything
necessary on this form and wait.

13:32.060 --> 13:34.770
I see, so this is the guild.

13:38.810 --> 13:41.190
There are so many strangers, right?

13:41.190 --> 13:42.150
But don't worry.

13:42.650 --> 13:43.940
They're not scary.

13:43.940 --> 13:45.110
- Okay...
- Okay...

13:45.110 --> 13:46.820
Sorry for the wait.

13:46.820 --> 13:49.070
These are your guild cards.

13:49.070 --> 13:52.120
It can be used as proof
of identity as well,

13:52.120 --> 13:53.790
so please keep it well.

13:53.790 --> 13:58.620
I turned into level 11!
I defeated some monsters back then.

13:58.620 --> 13:58.750
And I'm properly human now.

13:58.750 --> 14:01.000
(Human)
And I'm properly human now.

14:01.000 --> 14:03.800
Now, I will explain about the guild.

14:03.800 --> 14:03.940
The rank begins at Rank F, the Newcomer,
and progresses to Rank S, the Hero.

14:03.940 --> 14:05.070
(F (Newcomer) E (Novice))
The rank begins at Rank F, the Newcomer,
and progresses to Rank S, the Hero.

14:05.070 --> 14:06.700
(D (Established Adventurer) C (Adept))
The rank begins at Rank F, the Newcomer,
and progresses to Rank S, the Hero.

14:06.700 --> 14:08.700
(B (First-class) A (First-class＋α) S (Hero))
The rank begins at Rank F, the Newcomer,
and progresses to Rank S, the Hero.

14:08.720 --> 14:12.470
Rank SS exists above rank S,

14:12.470 --> 14:15.430
but at the moment there is no one
capable enough for it.

14:15.430 --> 14:19.480
Also, there's a party system for clearing
quests with multiple persons.

14:19.480 --> 14:23.400
The party rank will be the average
level of the members.

14:23.400 --> 14:28.240
You take quests by bringing the quest notices
plastered on the board to the receptionist,

14:28.240 --> 14:31.740
and you go for the quest
after finishing administration.

14:31.740 --> 14:36.040
Other than that, you can
appraise and sell items

14:36.040 --> 14:38.960
and monster drops other than quest items.

14:38.960 --> 14:42.630
That's all. Is there any question?

14:42.630 --> 14:43.920
No, thank you.

14:43.920 --> 14:47.300
Then, I want to register a party.

14:47.300 --> 14:50.300
All right. Please give me
the name of the party.

14:50.300 --> 14:51.970
Party name...

14:51.970 --> 14:53.640
Let's see...

14:53.720 --> 14:56.600
Since we're related to the Gods...

14:58.560 --> 15:00.060
Angel...

15:00.060 --> 15:01.310
Wings...

15:01.310 --> 15:02.520
White...

15:02.520 --> 15:03.980
White Wings!

15:04.770 --> 15:05.940
- Yes.
- Yes.

15:05.940 --> 15:09.070
Okay, we will register you
as White Wings.

15:09.070 --> 15:11.410
Would you like to take a quest as well?

15:12.240 --> 15:13.740
Gathering quest.

15:13.740 --> 15:16.700
A job of collecting herbs
and monster drops.

15:17.410 --> 15:18.790
Hunting quest.

15:18.790 --> 15:25.380
A job of defeating the required monsters
and bringing their body parts as proof.

15:25.380 --> 15:26.800
Protection quest.

15:26.800 --> 15:32.140
A job of protecting a certain area or
people and animals moving between cities.

15:32.140 --> 15:34.140
Anyway, for our first quest,

15:34.140 --> 15:36.970
why not take the easy
herb-gathering quest?

15:39.100 --> 15:41.600
So it'll be Lilie Herb's gathering.

15:41.600 --> 15:44.560
Ten Lilie Herb is worth
one quest completion.

15:44.560 --> 15:46.570
The limit is three days.

15:46.570 --> 15:48.320
Please be careful out there!

15:49.610 --> 15:52.990
Okay! This is our first job
as the White Wings!

15:58.910 --> 16:02.620
It's a slime.
It's a weak monster, so it'll be fine.

16:03.620 --> 16:07.090
This is a safe forest with only
rank E or F monsters, huh?

16:07.090 --> 16:09.050
It's perfect for our first job.

16:11.470 --> 16:13.470
Alan, Elena. Look over here.

16:14.180 --> 16:16.100
This is the Lilie Herb.

16:17.640 --> 16:20.480
Once you find it, do this and take it.

16:20.980 --> 16:21.980
Get it?

16:27.940 --> 16:29.030
- This one?
- This one?

16:29.030 --> 16:30.440
Did you find it already?

16:30.440 --> 16:32.200
Yes, these are the ones!

16:32.200 --> 16:33.650
You did so well!

16:34.780 --> 16:37.330
All right! Let's collect more of them!

16:37.330 --> 16:38.490
- Okay!
- Okay!

16:49.500 --> 16:53.720
T-This is an unbelievable amount of them!

16:53.720 --> 16:57.680
It's difficult to find
this many in half a day!

16:57.680 --> 16:59.850
The kids are helping me too.

17:02.020 --> 17:04.600
Okay. There's no problem.

17:05.390 --> 17:07.560
And this is your reward.

17:07.560 --> 17:10.440
This is the money for Alan
and Elena's hard work!

17:10.440 --> 17:11.400
You're amazing!

17:11.400 --> 17:14.070
Why are there kids in this place?!

17:18.280 --> 17:21.870
I brought the kids here,
is there any problem?

17:21.870 --> 17:22.790
What?

17:22.790 --> 17:26.250
This isn't a kids' playground!

17:26.250 --> 17:29.500
But both of them are being good.

17:29.500 --> 17:32.550
I don't think
they're disturbing you at all.

17:32.550 --> 17:34.550
They're a sore just by being here!

17:34.550 --> 17:35.510
Mr. Dominic!

17:35.510 --> 17:36.180
This kind of person exists in any world, huh...

17:36.180 --> 17:39.350
- This kind of person exists in any world, huh...
- Quarrel is forbidden within the guild. - Shut up!

17:39.350 --> 17:41.850
- Let's avoid him.
- Hey! Don't ignore me!

17:41.850 --> 17:44.350
How dare you look down on me!

17:45.890 --> 17:46.560
Oh no!

17:48.560 --> 17:50.150
Hey, stop there, stop!

17:50.150 --> 17:52.020
Wait, Alan! Elena!

17:53.820 --> 17:57.990
Um... for this case,
will there be punishment?

17:57.990 --> 18:00.700
No. That was self-defense, so...

18:00.700 --> 18:02.410
Hey, I'm coming in.

18:02.410 --> 18:04.870
Huh? What is this?

18:04.870 --> 18:06.710
Did something happen?

18:06.710 --> 18:11.590
Huh? That person is
the soldier I met by the gate.

18:11.590 --> 18:14.340
- Excuse me, Mr. Takumi.
- Yes?

18:14.340 --> 18:16.920
The kids, they're...

18:19.890 --> 18:22.010
Huh? Why are you crying?

18:22.010 --> 18:24.940
You're not hurt, right?
What's wrong?

18:25.600 --> 18:27.020
Don't go...

18:27.020 --> 18:28.480
Don't leave us...

18:28.480 --> 18:30.400
Leave you? Why?

18:30.980 --> 18:33.610
Is it because I yelled at them?

18:33.610 --> 18:36.070
Did they think I was angry?

18:39.820 --> 18:41.490
I won't leave you.

18:41.490 --> 18:43.410
It's fine, okay?

18:46.290 --> 18:48.830
So, what just happened?

18:48.830 --> 18:52.290
The truth is we were pestered by
an adventurer named Dominic.

18:52.840 --> 18:56.010
Ah, once again, I am Takumi Kayano.

18:56.010 --> 18:57.170
Yeah.

18:57.170 --> 19:00.890
I'm the Second Captain of the Shireen Division
of the Knights of the Kingdom Guadia,

19:00.890 --> 19:02.720
Granvault Lowain.

19:02.720 --> 19:04.680
That's gotta be rough.

19:04.680 --> 19:07.980
So, the kids were crying
because they were scared?

19:07.980 --> 19:11.400
No. It appears they thought
I would abandon them.

19:11.400 --> 19:14.070
What? You'll do that?

19:14.070 --> 19:16.030
I won't! You have the wrong idea!

19:16.030 --> 19:17.990
Then why would they think so?

19:19.320 --> 19:21.320
I'm not sure,

19:21.320 --> 19:24.950
but I have a hunch
if I remember how I met them.

19:26.370 --> 19:28.660
So they are not your kids?

19:28.660 --> 19:30.500
Aren't you siblings, then?

19:30.500 --> 19:33.130
No. I just met them.

19:34.920 --> 19:36.590
They were in the Forest of Gaia.

19:36.590 --> 19:37.630
- What?!
- What?!

19:39.130 --> 19:42.890
I don't know if they were dumped
in the forest or got lost in it.

19:42.890 --> 19:44.100
Really?

19:44.100 --> 19:50.060
Is there any news like carriages getting
attacked around the Forest of Gaia?

19:50.060 --> 19:51.730
Speaking of which,

19:51.730 --> 19:55.020
a slave trader group coming here
from the Algo Kingdom

19:55.020 --> 19:58.940
was attacked by monsters
from the Forest of Gaia!

19:58.940 --> 20:00.070
I knew it.

20:00.070 --> 20:03.990
Then, were they dropped from
the carriage to be decoys?

20:03.990 --> 20:05.780
This young...

20:07.950 --> 20:11.410
If that's the case, it is fine
if I take them in, right?

20:11.410 --> 20:14.540
It seems the kids grow close to you,

20:14.540 --> 20:18.590
so I'll approve you as their guardian
in my name as a captain.

20:18.590 --> 20:20.880
Thank you very much, Sir Lowain!

20:20.880 --> 20:22.970
Nah, just call me Vault.

20:22.970 --> 20:24.590
Oh right, Mr. Takumi!

20:24.590 --> 20:26.350
You went to the Forest of Gaia, right?!

20:26.350 --> 20:28.180
Yes, I did...

20:28.180 --> 20:31.230
Which means you have materials
from the Forest of Gaia, right?!

20:31.230 --> 20:33.310
- Do you?!
- Er...

20:33.310 --> 20:35.310
Well, I have dropped items
from Red Wolf...

20:35.310 --> 20:36.520
Red Wolf!

20:36.520 --> 20:38.230
Sell them, Takumi.

20:38.230 --> 20:40.230
This girl is crazy about materials.

20:40.230 --> 20:42.190
Thanks for your patronage.

20:42.190 --> 20:44.660
Wow, so much money.

20:44.660 --> 20:49.200
By the way, Sir Vault, aren't you
here to talk to the guild master?

20:49.200 --> 20:52.120
- Yeah, about the expedition.
- Expedition?

20:52.120 --> 20:56.460
We periodically go to the Forest of Gaia
and thin out the monsters.

20:56.460 --> 20:59.840
It'd be a problem if they ran loose
and spilled out of the forest.

20:59.840 --> 21:01.260
I see.

21:01.260 --> 21:03.840
So that's how you protect the city.

21:03.840 --> 21:05.720
It's an A-rank forest,

21:05.720 --> 21:09.310
so the people we can take are limited,
and we're low on people, too.

21:09.310 --> 21:12.140
That's why you should join too, Takumi.

21:12.140 --> 21:13.100
What?!

21:13.100 --> 21:15.560
Wait a second, my rank is F!

21:15.560 --> 21:19.060
You went to the Forest of Gaia alone,
defeated Red Wolf and lived,

21:19.060 --> 21:20.440
so there's no problem, right?

21:21.150 --> 21:22.610
Dammit...

21:22.610 --> 21:25.110
I shouldn't have told them
about the Red Wolf.

21:25.110 --> 21:27.820
Well, I will go talk to the guild master!

21:27.820 --> 21:28.820
W-Wait a minute!

21:28.820 --> 21:32.160
I'll submit the quest,
don't you run away, okay?

21:32.160 --> 21:33.000
See ya!

21:35.920 --> 21:38.920
It suddenly gets so troublesome...

21:38.920 --> 21:40.380
Will these two be okay?

21:40.380 --> 21:43.010
- Money...
- Hey now, don't eat that!

21:43.760 --> 21:46.430
Master, sorry to intrude
on your busy schedule.

21:46.430 --> 21:48.340
Is this about the expedition?

21:48.340 --> 21:51.890
Yes, I want to request
adventurers just like usual.

21:51.890 --> 21:53.310
Also, this time...

21:54.180 --> 21:58.270
I want to personally request
a person named Takumi Kayano.

21:59.150 --> 22:01.230
I've never heard that name before.

22:01.230 --> 22:03.530
He's a newcomer who just came to town.

22:03.530 --> 22:05.530
Do you want a newcomer
for the expedition?

22:06.950 --> 22:08.570
Although he's a newcomer,

22:09.280 --> 22:11.120
it doesn't mean he's a beginner.

22:28.470 --> 22:32.510
♪Forever, all the time♪

22:32.510 --> 22:35.600
♪I just can't keep crying♪

22:35.600 --> 22:36.730
♪Ah! Ah!♪

22:36.730 --> 22:40.350
♪In happy moments and sad moments♪

22:40.350 --> 22:42.980
♪If I am with you♪

22:45.150 --> 22:47.150
♪Such a good weather♪

22:47.150 --> 22:50.780
♪Today, let's go slowly♪

22:50.780 --> 22:53.120
♪While taking detours♪

22:53.120 --> 22:57.660
♪The clear sky,
the wind caressing my cheeks♪

22:57.660 --> 23:00.920
♪And your gentle gaze♪

23:00.920 --> 23:04.170
♪Beyond an unknown road♪

23:04.170 --> 23:06.130
♪The wind blows past♪

23:06.130 --> 23:09.220
♪The curtain of light sways♪

23:09.880 --> 23:13.510
♪Maybe we should try going
I just feel like it♪

23:13.510 --> 23:20.100
♪No matter what happens
we can laugh anyway♪

23:22.310 --> 23:26.320
♪Forever, all the time♪

23:26.440 --> 23:29.320
♪I just can't keep crying♪

23:29.320 --> 23:30.570
♪Ah! Ah!♪

23:30.570 --> 23:34.070
♪In happy moments and sad moments♪

23:34.070 --> 23:37.120
♪If I am with you♪

23:38.290 --> 23:43.130
♪I am sure I'll be content♪

23:44.980 --> 23:45.630
(Next Episode)

23:45.630 --> 23:48.300
(Next Episode) (Nice to meet you, Joule)
Nice to meet you, Joule.

23:48.300 --> 23:49.990
(Next Episode) (Nice to meet you, Joule)
